  leftText: 
  rightText: Trinkets are powerful items that can bestow potent effects when worn.
    Each trinket has a unique effect, and some have stackable effects. When removing
    a trinket, it has the chance to break based on the remaining durability. If a
    trinket's durability were to reach 0, each further use will have a chance to
    break it.
